      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "content": "# COZ Daily Brief Automation - Monitoring Dashboard\n\n## Health Status Indicators\n\n- **HEALTHY (2)**: All systems operational\n- **DEGRADED (1)**: Some checks failing but system functional\n- **UNHEALTHY (0)**: Critical failure, system needs attention\n\n## Health Checks\n\n1. **output_directory**: Can write to output directory\n2. **disk_space**: Sufficient disk space (>100MB)\n3. **parsers**: COZ parsers initialized successfully\n4. **recent_briefs**: Recent briefs generated (<48 hours)\n5. **hololoom**: hololoom refinement available (optional)\n\n## Quick Actions\n\n- Check health: `python elle/coz/health_check.py`\n- View logs: `sudo journalctl -u coz-daily-brief -f`\n- Restart service: `sudo systemctl restart coz-daily-brief`\n- Generate brief manually: `python elle/coz/daily_brief_automation.py --once`\n\n## Alert Thresholds\n\n- **CRITICAL**: Health status < 1 for >10 minutes\n- **WARNING**: Failed checks >= 2 for >10 minutes\n- **INFO**: No recent brief for >24 hours",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "8.0.0",
      "title": "Dashboard Guide",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Recent Metrics\n\n**Last Update**: {{ coz_automation_last_check_timestamp_ms }}\n\n**System Status**:\n- Overall Health: {{ coz_automation_health_status }}\n- Failed Checks: {{ coz_automation_checks_failed }}\n- Total Checks: {{ coz_automation_checks_total }}\n\n**Individual Checks**:\n- Output Directory: {{ coz_automation_check_status{check=\"output_directory\"} }}\n- Disk Space: {{ coz_automation_check_status{check=\"disk_space\"} }}\n- Parsers: {{ coz_automation_check_status{check=\"parsers\"} }}\n- Recent Briefs: {{ coz_automation_check_status{check=\"recent_briefs\"} }}\n- hololoom: {{ coz_automation_check_status{check=\"hololoom\"} }}\n\n## Prometheus Queries\n\n```promql\n# Overall health\ncoz_automation_health_status\n\n# Failed checks over time\nrate(coz_automation_checks_failed[5m])\n\n# Check status by type\ncoz_automation_check_status{check=\"parsers\"}\n```",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "8.0.0",
